  "description": "For the past 13 years, Lucia has harbored a not-so-secret crush on her childhood friend, Herwyn. After 99 rejected confessions, she’s determined to move on. But just as she prepares to accept her arranged engagement, fate takes an unexpected turn. When jealousy flares and hearts collide, Herwyn and Lucia are about to find out they’re not done with each other yet. They say third time’s the charm, but could this final chance be the one that changes everything?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
